Both parties shall maintain the following insurance coverage:

- General Liability Insurance: Minimum coverage of $5 million per occurrence.
- Environmental Liability Insurance: Minimum coverage of $3 million per occurrence.

7.2 **Indemnification**  
Each party agrees to indemnify and hold harmless the other party from any claims, damages, or liabilities arising out of their respective operations under this agreement, including but not limited to environmental violations or accidents.

